Windows: 14 rustkit-engine media tests (media_fetch_tests, media_load_tests) need a media backend to
fetch and read media: MEDIA-AVF plays media through AVFoundation, which exists on macOS only, so here
canPlayType answers "" and no metadata fetch starts. They are ignored on Windows with that reason (the
Windows media backend row). media_box_tests (no media needed) run and pass.

Remove when Windows has a media backend.

